      "sourceHash": "59a1a165dbf5f6fa",
      "translationZh": "在 TGI 上运行的聊天演示（70B）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2ce42fe2efc2a70",
      "translationZh": "Llama 2 发布了，我们非常兴奋！接下来的几天里，准备好进一步了解如何自行进行微调、在设备端运行最小的模型，以及我们正在为你准备的许多其他令人兴奋的新动态！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
